Apache-2.0 (upstream material) and MIT (this repository's own files).

The fetched material under upstream/ and the files copied from it into src/
(each carries a header naming origin and commit) are from
SAP-samples/abap-platform-refscen-flight, which is Apache-2.0. The full
licence text is that repository's LICENSE file and the copy this repository
keeps at LICENSES/Apache-2.0.txt; the copyright line is in NOTICE beside
this file. The copies in src/ are modified, every change marked "OSD
overlay" in the source.

Everything else in this pack -- the seed class, the service YAML, the DDIC
stand-ins, the manifest -- is this repository's own material under the MIT
licence at the repository root.
